UID:7MYSSSAfwQdweUbxHaFjV
SUMMARY:CEOs: Build With AI\, Exit With a Premium
DTSTAMP:20260803T120113Z
DTSTART:20260804T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/7cin813l \nMost founders use AI
	 to cut costs. Smart founders use it to double their exit price. \nLet’s b
	e honest: everyone is obsessed with saving a few bucks using ChatGPT. But 
	when it comes to selling your company\, buyers don’t care about your cool 
	prompts\, they care about scalable\, defensible value. Right now\, most co
	mpanies are building generic AI setups that anyone can copy\, missing the 
	chance to secure a massive premium. \nJoin Blue People for an unfiltered\,
	 no-BS session with David Lopez. \nDavid is here to help tech leaders and 
	CEOs sober up from the AI hype and look at real valuation. He’ll break dow
	n why simply “using AI” isn’t enough\, and how to position your company so
	 buyers pay a premium\, not a discount. \nKey Takeaways: \n– The AI Premiu
	m: Identify exactly what AI capabilities buyers pay top dollar for before 
	you go to market.\n– The Multipliers: Implement the 3 AI strategic moves t
	hat actually multiply your company’s value.\n– Kill the Discount: Use AI s
	ystems to eliminate founder-dependency and make your business truly turn-k
	ey. \nStop treating AI like a basic productivity tool. Start building an a
	sset that drives your exit. \nAbout David Lopez: \nDavid is a specialist i
	n strategic growth and enterprise value. He helps CEOs transform operation
	s through AI\, moving businesses away from founder-dependence and position
	ing them for high-value\, premium exits. \nDate & Time: Tuesday\, August 4
	th\, 2026 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM\nLocation: The Ion Houston Hosted by Blue Peop
	le \n👉 Ask about our parking options at the end of the event!\n\nhttps://i
	ondistrict.com/event/ceos-build-with-ai-exit-with-a-premium/\n\nFrom Ion D
	istrict
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/ceos-build-with-ai-exit-with-a-premium/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
