UID:bzq_RSQ8SWieUaizHGzZl
SUMMARY:Big3 at Toyota Center
DTSTAMP:20260803T120113Z
DTSTART:20260806T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Big3\, a professional 3-on-3 half-court 
	basketball league co-founded by Ice Cube\, to the Downtown arena’s court f
	or 2 games on Sunday\, July 26\, 2026 and Thursday\, August 6\, 2026. \nJu
	st one ticket gets admission to both games\, which combine basketball\, en
	tertainment\, and family fun and \nBig3 Game Schedule\n\nDMV Trilogy vs. M
	iami 305 | Sunday\, July 26\, 2026 at 11:30am\nHouston Rig Hands vs. Dalla
	s Power | Thursday\, August 6\, 2026 at 7pm\n\nAdmission\nTickets are $45 
	and a single ticket admits you to both games. Get tickets or learn more. \
	n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer an
	d boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about
	 promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of o
	ur channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/big3-at-toyota-ce
	nter-2/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/big3-at-toyota-center-2/
LOCATION:Toyota Center\, 1510 Polk St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
