SUMMARY:ENRG HTX - August 2026
DTSTAMP:20260803T120113Z
DTSTART:20260821T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/enrg-htx-august-202
	6-tickets-1992146493790?aff=oddtdtcreator \nENRG (Entrepreneurial Networki
	ng Resource Group) is a community for entrepreneurs with 10-250 employees 
	running on EOS or EOS Curious. \n\n\n\nENRG (pronounced energy) is here to
	 stay in Houston! \nErick Garcia\, Lesa A Skipper and Craig Ceccanti are t
	eaming up to build the Houston ENRG Chapter and we could not be more excit
	ed to invite entrepreneurs running on EOS or EOS Curious to this collabora
	tive room! Join us on August 21st at 8:30am at the Ion District (Downstair
	s 028) for the first meeting! \nWhat is ENRG?\nThe vision is to establish 
	an ENRG (Entrepreneurial Networking Resource Group) in Houston for entrepr
	eneurs with 10-250 employees. This is a free EOS Worldwide aligned communi
	ty for entrepreneurs led by one EOS Implementer and one Integrator. \nEach
	 monthly meeting includes:\n– Practical training on an EOS tools\n– Peer-t
	o-peer issue solving\n– Valuable networking\n– Content that helps move the
	 needle on your business\n– Exposure to Subject Matter Experts\nNo sales p
	itches here though\, we’re here to help all tides rise! \nThis is WHERE en
	trepreneurs find the WHOs and the HOWs to move their business forward.\n\n
	https://iondistrict.com/event/enrg-htx-july-2026/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/enrg-htx-july-2026/
LOCATION:Ion – Conference Room 028\, 4201 Main St.\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
