SUMMARY:Illuminate: The Official Launch Experience
DTSTAMP:20260803T120113Z
DTSTART:20260827T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/LaunchExperience \n​Illuminate 
	is the official public launch experience for Lumino. Join founders\, merch
	ants\, creators\, investors\, and community leaders for a full day of keyn
	otes\, industry breakout sessions\, and networking as we unveil the Lumino
	 ecosystem and the future of Local Conscious Commerce. \n​The day moves th
	rough three keynote acts — Past\, Present\, and Future — tracing Lumino’s 
	founding story\, what’s live today\, and where the platform is headed. Fro
	m there\, guests choose an industry-specific breakout session\, hear from 
	a lineup of champion speakers\, and close the day at a happy hour with our
	 first-floor restaurant partners. \n​Agenda \n​8:30 AM Guest arrival \n​9:
	00–10:00 AM Past — Lumino State of the Union \n​10:00–11:00 AM Present — T
	he Lumino Launch Keynote \n​11:00 AM–11:30 AM Future — The Future of Lumin
	o & Global Conscious Commerce \n​11:30–12:30 PM Lunch\, served in Lower Lo
	bby \n​12:30–1:30 PM Breakout sessions: Non-Profit\, Hospitality\, Online 
	Coaching\, Startup\, Payment Processing \n​2:00–2:30 PM Eric Rock – Missio
	n Project \n​2:30— 3:00 PM Champion Keynote (Coming Soon) \n​3:00–4:00 PM 
	Micro keynotes (15 min each) \n​4:00–6:00 PM Happy hour — 1st floor restau
	rant partners\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/illuminate-the-official-lau
	nch-experience/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/illuminate-the-official-launch-experience
	/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT10H
END:VEVENT
