UID:IXleMgD2QQOzw9dmittuL
SUMMARY:K-Pop Mini Con
DTSTAMP:20260803T120113Z
DTSTART:20261017T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🎤✨ K-Pop Mini Con — A Celebration of All Things K-Pop ✨🎤\nGet y
	our lightsticks ready because K-Pop Mini Con is bringing fans together for
	 a full day celebrating everything we love about K-pop! CCS Houston is cre
	ating a space for stans\, collectors\, dancers\, creators\, and fans to co
	nnect through the music\, fashion\, performances\, and fandom culture that
	 make K-pop so special. 💜✨ \nFrom your favorite groups and iconic eras to 
	album collections\, photocards\, fan creations\, and unforgettable perform
	ances\, K-Pop Mini Con is a place where you can celebrate the artists and 
	communities that inspire you. \n  \n🗓️ Date & Time: Saturday\, October 17\,
	 2026 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 770
	36\n🎟️ FREE Entry & FREE Parking \n  \n🌟 EVENT HIGHLIGHTS 🌟\n🛍️ K-Pop Market
	place – All Day\nSearching for that one photocard you’ve been missing\, th
	e album you’ve been wanting\, or the perfect piece to represent your favor
	ite group? The marketplace is where the K-pop hunt begins. \n  \n💃 K-Pop C
	osplay & Fashion Showcase\nBring your favorite idol looks\, stage-inspired
	 outfits\, fan fashion\, or your own creative style to the showcase! From 
	iconic music video outfits to original fan creations\, show off the looks 
	that make you feel like you belong on stage. ✨ \n  \n🌸 Interested in Being
	 a Vendor?\nHave K-pop-inspired creations\, collectibles\, or fan favorite
	s to share? Join a marketplace where stans can discover new treasures and 
	connect over the artists they love.\nVendor Application: https://tinyurl.c
	om/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n👥 We’re Looking for Collaborators \n🕹️ A
	ctivity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🎤 Workshops & Panels 
	→ https://forms.gle/x39jXcXuj8hhf8Re7\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms
	.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \n🛍️ Vendor Application → https://tinyurl.com/CCSGue
	stVendorFromHouston \nHave a love for K-pop and want to be part of the adv
	enture? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 📩 \n  \nBr
	ing your friends and join fellow fans for a day celebrating the music\, ar
	tists\, and fandom culture that make K-pop unforgettable. CCS K-Pop Mini C
	on. One fandom. Countless favorites. All under one roof. 🎤💜\n\nhttps://ccs
	-houston.com/events/k-pop-mini-con/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/k-pop-mini-con/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
